## Core build outputs
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Log]s/

## Visual Studio working files
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## VS Code settings and workspace files
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json

## Rider / JetBrains IDEs
.idea/
*.sln.iml

## ASP.NET Core specific exclusions
### Local secrets management (NEVER commit secrets to source control)
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json
secrets.json

### Frontend build artifacts (if using Angular, React, etc.)
node_modules/
/wwwroot/dist/
dist/

### Compiled publish output
/publish/
/out/

## Operating system files
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

## Unity-проект (папка CombineQueries/) - генерируемое не версионируем
/CombineQueries/[Ll]ibrary/
/CombineQueries/[Tt]emp/
/CombineQueries/[Oo]bj/
/CombineQueries/[Bb]uild*/
/CombineQueries/[Ll]ogs/
/CombineQueries/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/CombineQueries/ClientSimStorage/
/CombineQueries/*.sln
/CombineQueries/*.csproj
/CombineQueries/.vs/

### Результат компиляции UdonSharp, ~107 МБ. Пересобирается при первом открытии.
/CombineQueries/Assets/SerializedUdonPrograms/
/CombineQueries/Assets/SerializedUdonPrograms.meta

### Пакеты ставит VCC по манифестам - в репо едут только они
/CombineQueries/Packages/*
!/CombineQueries/Packages/manifest.json
!/CombineQueries/Packages/vpm-manifest.json
!/CombineQueries/Packages/packages-lock.json

### Настройки окружений - в них строки подключения и токены
/CombineQueries.Extension.Server/VQueries/appsettings.Alpha.json
/CombineQueries.Extension.Server/VQueries/appsettings.Production.json

### Окружение клиента - адреса и токен, в гит не едут (рядом лежат .example)
/Udon/CombineQueries.dev.cs
/Udon/CombineQueries.alpha.cs
/Udon/CombineQueries.prod.cs
/CombineQueries/Assets/CombineQueries/CombineQueries.dev.cs
/CombineQueries/Assets/CombineQueries/CombineQueries.dev.cs.meta
